{"id":"wb-7-940","name":"银冈书院","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"银冈书院","text":"银冈书院位于现今中华人民共和国辽宁省铁岭市银州区，是一座始建于清朝顺治年间的书院，被相关专家认为是中国东北地区建院最早、影响最大、保存最完好、最有代表性的书院。现为中国全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%93%B6%E5%86%88%E4%B9%A6%E9%99%A2","revisionId":86783277,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86783277","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/03afd56c0e5f01f4c20507bb.jpg","title":"Tieling_-_Yingang_Shuyuan.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Tieling_-_Yingang_Shuyuan.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/9d/Tieling_-_Yingang_Shuyuan.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Yoshi Canopus","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"Tieling - Yingang Shuyuan","width":320,"height":213}}